{"availability":"available","full":"lawoflarge/appstore-command-center","name":"appstore-command-center","description":"Self-hosted App Store Connect + AdMob dashboard for iOS solo devs: downloads, unified revenue (ads + in-app & subscriptions, broken down by app and day), reviews, ASO rank, rules-based insights. Daily Vercel cron -> git-as-database -> liquid-glass UI. Zero recurring cost. Next.js 15 + GitHub OAuth.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-19T17:45:13Z","updated":"2026-10-11T04:23:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://appstore-command-center.vercel.app","topics":["app-store-connect","asc-api","aso","dashboard","git-as-database","indie-dev","ios","nextjs","self-hosted","typescript","vercel","zero-cost"],"demo":"https://appstore-command-center.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.145Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.145Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.145Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.145Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A private, single-user dashboard that pulls App Store Connect data daily and turns it into a monitoring + growth tool for your own iOS apps. Built to run on Vercel's free tier with zero recurring cost: no database, no LLM bills, no SaaS. Daily Vercel Cron auto-discovers every app on your Apple Developer account, runs five collectors (sales, analytics funnel, reviews, ratings, keyword-rank), and commits the raw data as partitioned JSON into a separate private git repo used as the database. A rules-based intelligence layer surfaces anomalies, funnel leaks, keyword opportunities, and a month-end…","Designed for the case \"I run a handful of iOS apps and want one dashboard instead of bouncing between App Store Connect, Sensor Tower, and a spreadsheet.\" Not a competitor-tracker, not an MMP: just your apps, end-to-end honest.","App Store Connect's web UI is fine for one-off lookups and useless as a daily driver. Real third-party stacks start at \\$50-\\$200/month and assume you're running an ad budget. This project is the middle path: an opinionated dashboard you self-host on Vercel Hobby for free, that pulls exactly the same numbers Apple gives you, sliced the way you want."],"features":["Git as DB: serverless-friendly, immune to free-tier pauses, full audit trail, cheap to clone for offline analysis. The price is sequential commits: solved with retry-on-409 backoff.","Per-app parallelization: each app writes disjoint paths, so Promise.all across apps is safe and brings 4-app wall-clock from 60s+ down to 30s.","No LLM dependency: review clustering + weekly digest were dropped to keep operating cost at $0. Reviews are still collected and listed.","Single-user OAuth allowlist: simplest possible auth that's not \"no auth\". For multi-user, swap the signIn callback for a real ACL."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"508a10192a0e8442d2f47431ccc9fee61148fed5a472794e60d4fa81388118ec","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.288Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.288Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A private, single-user dashboard that pulls App Store Connect data daily and turns it into a monitoring + growth tool for your own iOS apps. Built to run on Vercel's free tier with zero recurring cost: no database, no LLM bills, no SaaS. Daily Vercel Cron auto-discovers every app on your Apple Developer account, runs five collectors (sales, analytics funnel, reviews, ratings, keyword-rank), and commits the raw data as partitioned JSON into a separate private git repo used as the database. A rules-based intelligence layer surfaces anomalies, funnel leaks, keyword opportunities, and a month-end…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Designed for the case \"I run a handful of iOS apps and want one dashboard instead of bouncing between App Store Connect, Sensor Tower, and a spreadsheet.\" Not a competitor-tracker, not an MMP: just your apps, end-to-end honest.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"This project is the middle path: an opinionated dashboard you self-host on Vercel Hobby for free, that pulls exactly the same numbers Apple gives you, sliced the way you want.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Auth is locked to a single GitHub username via the signIn callback.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The signIn callback rejects everyone except the configured ALLOWEDGITHUBLOGIN.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"508a10192a0e8442d2f47431ccc9fee61148fed5a472794e60d4fa81388118ec","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.288Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T04:23:11Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lawoflarge/appstore-command-center/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:49.289Z","hash":"508a10192a0e8442d2f47431ccc9fee61148fed5a472794e60d4fa81388118ec","originalBytes":12002,"storedBytes":12002,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["app","data","github","cron","repo","apple","asc","oauth","apps","private","api","day","key","secret","store","vercel","client","page","per","revenue","settings","create","daily","dashboard","every","funnel","json","keyword","reviews","sales","subscriptions","auth","connect","contents","first","hobby","month","one","pnpm","reports","run","access","add","a